FEATURES=[('Shadow: original pulsar/noise synthesis inspired by Opal Dust by Fors. Color: Grain; Shape: Density; Sweep: Spread; Contour: Chaos. It appears after TINY and before MIDI Out.', 'Shadow : synthese pulsar/bruit originale inspiree de Opal Dust de Fors. Color : Grain ; Shape : Density ; Sweep : Spread ; Contour : Chaos. Apres TINY, avant MIDI Out.'), ('Machine browsing retains the six synth controls within each engine’s range. Sample Wizard keeps its four dials separate during the current MACHINES session, so passing through it preserves other engines’ values.', 'La selection conserve les six commandes synth dans les limites du moteur. Wizard garde ses quatre commandes separees pendant la session MACHINES, sans changer les valeurs des autres moteurs.'), ('Machines: In addition to the six stock engines, there are now several new machines:<br>Sample Wizard, SD Vintage, Clap Vintage, SY Toy, SY Bits, Swarm LITE, MACRO, ACID, WAVE, Feral, Elder, TINY, Shadow and MIDI Out.', 'Machines : en plus des six moteurs d’origine, plusieurs nouvelles machines sont disponibles :<br>Sample Wizard, SD Vintage, Clap Vintage, SY Toy, SY Bits, Swarm LITE, MACRO, ACID, WAVE, Feral, Elder, TINY, Shadow et MIDI Out.'), ('MIDI Out: Send and sequence MIDI Out to any channel with 9 assignable CCs, p-locks, channel/port routing and two MIDI LFOs.', 'MIDI Out : envoyez et sequencez du MIDI sur n’importe quel canal avec 9 CC assignables, des p-locks, le routage canal/port et deux LFO MIDI.'), ('Sound shaping: Per-track attack, Polivoks style, two-pole resonant low pass filter all available as quick-assignable LFO destinations.', 'Sculpture sonore : attaque par piste et filtre passe-bas resonant deux poles inspire du Polivoks, tous disponibles comme destinations LFO a assignation rapide.'), ('FX menus: hold TRACK + REVERB SIZE or DELAY TIME. Opaque popups over the normal screen; browse up/down without changing sound; release TRACK to apply, BACK to cancel. Includes chorus + reverb and Vinyl + reverb.', 'Menus FX : TRACK+REVERB SIZE ou DELAY TIME, fenetres opaques par-dessus l’ecran normal. Parcourir sans changer le son ; relacher TRACK applique,BACK annule. Chorus+reverb et Vinyl+reverb inclus.'), ('Combined FX keep plain Size/Time native. FUNC changes the added effect; hold FUNC first, then TRACK for Depth/Bits. FUNC + Send adjusts the separate effect send. In combined modes, hold SETTINGS and turn REVERB SIZE for Reverb Tone or DELAY TIME for Delay Feedback; standard REVERB mode keeps FUNC + REVERB SIZE for Tone.', 'FX combines : Size/Time simples restent natifs. FUNC regle l’effet ajoute ; FUNC puis TRACK pour Depth/Bits. FUNC+Send dose l’effet distinct. En modes combines, maintenez SETTINGS et tournez REVERB SIZE pour Reverb Tone ou DELAY TIME pour Delay Feedback ; le mode REVERB standard garde FUNC+REVERB SIZE pour Tone.'), ('New delays: TRACK + DELAY TIME, turn left/up past CRUSH 1/2 for PING PONG, SHIMMER 1 and SHIMMER 2. Release TRACK to apply. Ping Pong alternates stereo echoes. Shimmer 1 shifts every echo up an octave; Shimmer 2 keeps the earlier mixed, diffuse sound. TIME adjusts time, FUNC + TIME or SETTINGS + TIME adjusts feedback, DELAY SEND sets the per-track amount.', 'Nouveaux delays : TRACK+DELAY TIME gauche/haut apres CRUSH1/2 pour PING PONG,SHIMMER1,SHIMMER2. Relacher TRACK applique. Ping Pong alterne les echos stereo. Shimmer1 transpose chaque echo d une octave ; Shimmer2 garde le melange diffuse precedent. TIME : temps ; FUNC+TIME ou SETTINGS+TIME : feedback ; DELAY SEND : dosage par piste.'), ('Vinyl: bright record pops and clicks continue through musical gaps, independently of source loudness. Crackle, Warble Amount and Warble Speed; Vinyl Send 0 is dry and Crackle 0 silences dust. Track level, pan and mute apply.', 'Vinyl : pops et clics brillants de disque, continus dans les pauses et independants du niveau du son. Crackle, Warble Amount et Warble Speed ; Vinyl Send0 sec, Crackle0 coupe la poussiere. Volume,pan et mute de piste respectes.'), ('Audio beat-repeat latch: hold TRACK and double-tap RETRIG, then release both. Steps remain momentary. FUNC + SETTINGS/PATTERN temp save/reload remain available. BACK exits; copy/paste/clear is blocked while latched.', 'Verrou beat repeat : maintenir TRACK et taper deux fois RETRIG, puis relacher les deux. Pas momentanes. FUNC+SETTINGS/PATTERN temporaires disponibles. BACK quitte ; copier/coller/effacer bloques dans le verrou.'), ('Second LFO, Arpeggiator, ChordKeys.', 'Second LFO, arpegiateur, ChordKeys.'), ('Sequence Genie, an in-scale sequence generator with user adjustable parameters such as note range, velocity variation, etc. as well as euclidean options.', 'Sequence Genie, un generateur de sequences en gamme avec des parametres reglables tels que la plage de notes, les variations de velocite, etc., ainsi que des options euclidiennes.'), ('SCRAMBLE: quick-tap Settings+Track to randomize your chosen parameters. In Mod Setup, open SCRM with DATA and select Pitch, Decay, Color, Shape, Sweep and Contour independently for each track. Press DATA to toggle a checkbox; BACK returns. Choices are saved and apply to marked sequencer steps too.', 'SCRAMBLE : appui bref Settings+Track pour les parametres choisis. Dans Mod Setup, ouvrez SCRM avec DATA et choisissez Pitch,Decay,Color,Shape,Sweep et Contour par piste. DATA coche ; BACK revient. Choix sauvegardes et appliques aux pas marques.'), ('Mod Menu: Long pressing the SCRAMBLE Combo opens up the Mod Menu where you can find toggles for some of the features available in this mod. They are set to stock modes by default but save upon exiting this menu. Togglable features include: Silent Track Switching, 6/2ch USB audio, Vol/Pan as numbers, latching mute mode, delay as time divisions, and a diagnostic CPU load pop-up that appears only after physically holding Track + Retrig for at least 350 ms and releasing; latching retrig never triggers it.', 'Mod Menu : maintenez la combinaison SCRAMBLE pour ouvrir le menu des options du mod. Les modes d’origine sont selectionnes par defaut et les reglages sont sauvegardes en quittant le menu. Options disponibles : changement de piste silencieux, audio USB 6/2 canaux, Vol/Pan en chiffres, mode mute verrouillable, delay en divisions temporelles et diagnostic de charge CPU affiche seulement apres maintien physique Track+Retrig d’au moins350ms puis relachement ; aucun popup depuis le verrou.'), ('Step Recorder: with playback stopped, double-press REC to enter; play notes to write them step by step. REC exits. In latched mute mode, hold FUNC and press a track pad to solo; press the soloed pad again or leave mute mode to restore the previous mutes.', 'Step Recorder : lecture arretee, appuyez deux fois sur REC pour entrer ; jouez des notes pour les enregistrer pas a pas. REC quitte. En mode mute verrouille, maintenez FUNC et appuyez sur un pad de piste pour le solo ; rappuyez sur ce pad ou quittez le mode mute pour restaurer les mutes precedents.'), ('Permanent quick save, updated MACRO Lo-Fi/rendering and audio/filter fixes.', 'Sauvegarde rapide permanente, MACRO Lo-Fi/rendu actualises et corrections audio/filtre.'), ('Live MIDI OUT/THRU combination toggle.', 'Bascule MIDI OUT/THRU en direct par combinaison de touches.')]

def render_features():
 # Texte approuve par AveyCole, commun au generateur et a la page principale.
 listing='<div class="fixed-features"><h3><span data-l="en">Included features</span><span data-l="fr">Fonctions incluses</span></h3><ul>'
 listing+=''.join('<li><span data-l="en">'+en+'</span><span data-l="fr">'+fr+'</span></li>' for en,fr in FEATURES)
 listing+='</ul><p><strong><span data-l="en">AND MORE!</span><span data-l="fr">ET BIEN PLUS !</span></strong></p>'
 listing+='<p><a href="release-notes-2.27.html"><span data-l="en">Full release notes</span><span data-l="fr">Notes de version completes</span></a></p>'
 listing+='<a href="#step-file"><span data-l="en">Continue: load OS files</span><span data-l="fr">Continuer : charger les OS</span></a></div>'
 return listing

